{"errno":0,"msg":"","data":[{"id":2492534,"ctime":1790247318,"title":"江苏银行、邮储银行、渤海银行、广发银行被罚，相关违法行为披露","brief":"①江苏银行因13项违法违规行为被罚款937.1万元； \n②中国邮政储蓄银行因十项违法违规行为被罚款1743.3万元；\n③渤海银行被罚没542.88万元，广发银行合计罚没约1714万元。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/gKrIfXHOs1_1000x667.jpg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492534,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"财联社","reading_num":149201,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492495,"ctime":1790244760,"title":"南向资金追踪｜净买入约29亿港元 流入腾讯减持中芯国际","brief":"①南向资金当日成交约630亿港元，资金持续流入哪些个股？\n②资金流入腾讯超6亿港元，近期持仓趋势有何变化？","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/GdxvML0o3W_600x378.jpeg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492495,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"冯轶","reading_num":272755,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492462,"ctime":1790243337,"title":"三季报行情预热！40余股已披露相关数据，近十年10月复盘，哪些方向历史战绩较佳？","brief":"①三季报行情逐步预热，截至今日发稿时，累计已有近40只个股发布业绩相关数据。\n②目前已披露业绩数据的40余股中，机械设备、医药生物股数量较多，分别占比达24.4%、17.1%。\n③目前，沪市个股三季报预约披露时间已经出炉，半导体股有研新材拔得头筹，将于10月13日发布公告。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/Txe678Znh1_1000x800.jpg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492462,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"梓隆","reading_num":157281,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492461,"ctime":1790243320,"title":"8·28新政后厦门现房销售“第一枪”拍出新地王 建发35.6亿元获得","brief":"①8·28新政后的厦门首场土拍，其中一宗地块的成交楼面价，刷新了厦门涉宅用地楼面价最高纪录；\n②中指院分析师指出，这是8·28新政后厦门首宗，也是福建省内首宗明确以“现售”方式出让并成交的住宅地块。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG41N901506826_4e3a0029ad934087a084f4a10216a949_1790243311.jpeg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492461,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"李洁","reading_num":238294,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492451,"ctime":1790243019,"title":"美联储“三号人物”：年内或有必要再次加息 以抑制通胀","brief":"①纽约联储行长威廉姆斯表示，美联储可能需要在年内再次加息以缓解通胀风险；\n②市场预测美联储年底前再加息至少一次的概率已经超过九成；\n③威廉姆斯认为通胀问题仍然是一项挑战，需要及时将通胀拉回目标水平。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG41N1456875542_91ae384baf0a412ba599d3f7e271eb70_1790242704.jpeg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492451,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"刘蕊","reading_num":188687,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492439,"ctime":1790243003,"title":"全球债务突破365万亿美元 经济学家警告“恶性循环”风险","brief":"①国际金融协会（IIF）发布的研究显示，今年上半年全球债务增加10万亿美元，首次突破365万亿美元；\n②IIF补充称：“随着基准利率上升，利息支出势必大幅增加，而医疗保健和公共养老金支出的结构性压力仍基本没有得到解决。”","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG111529009395_223bedcac31f46949d357cc75c2d7501_1790242214.jpeg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492439,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"赵昊","reading_num":189019,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492433,"ctime":1790242689,"title":"【焦点复盘】沪指光脚中阴再失3900点，全市场超4300股飘绿，近端次新人气股遭30cm2连跌停","brief":"①连板晋级率升至四成，短线投机方向分化加剧，福建本地股午后大放异彩，福建水泥等近十股涨停；近端次新股持续退潮，北交所世纪数码连续2日30cm 跌停； ②微盘股指数此前创阶段新高的同时，日线MACD仍未实现向上金叉，短线若失守5日均线，谨防顶背离形态引发的补跌风险","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/voKOXW5TvI_672x444.png","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492433,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"金皓明","reading_num":177711,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492436,"ctime":1790242293,"title":"独家丨监管明确险资港股通ETF投资口径，南向“长钱活水”可期","brief":"①可投资港股通股票的保险机构可以投资港股通ETF；\n②参照保险资金投资港股通股票的相关监管规定执行；\n③港股通ETF丰富险资境外配置工具箱，缓解行业QDII额度瓶颈。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG41N2286224811_1392f224bb424d08b8515bb02ea20541_1790242290.jpeg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492436,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"夏淑媛","reading_num":196742,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492434,"ctime":1790242235,"title":"跨境支付互联互通服务形式持续丰富，腾讯发布首个面向境外用户的来华支付工具","brief":"①腾讯首次公开发布面向海外用户的来华支付工具TenPayGo ；\n②相关负责人接受采访称，更聚焦于短期来华境外人士的需求，在现有支付服务之外，提供多一种选择；\n ③近年来监管持续推动下，国内各大支付平台加快有关跨境支付互联互通。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG41N1391101092_64a43d9548d4475cb0d09b249e6e6e6b_1790242222.jpeg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492434,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"邹俊涛","reading_num":235890,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492432,"ctime":1790242064,"title":"央行：加强对扩大内需、科技创新、中小微企业、“六张网”建设等重点领域的金融支持","brief":"","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/ZgoVtZN2k5_800x561.jpg","level":"C","article_tag":null,"source":"财联社","reading_num":182873,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492422,"ctime":1790241761,"title":"摩根士丹利：中国工业首次从“追赶”到“领跑”，80万亿新增资本开支利好哪些赛道？","brief":"①摩根士丹利提出工业5.0以工业智能化、工业韧性、工业领导力为三大支柱，中国工业将首次从“追赶”转向“领跑”；\n②报告测算，工业5.0带来约80万亿元人民币增量资本开支机会；\n③传统经济仍处于深度调整，邢自强强调，“反内卷”不是反对投资而是筛选投资。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/647ZEeCv5S_1024x683.jpg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492422,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"周晓雅","reading_num":238617,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492418,"ctime":1790241514,"title":"【数据看盘】西大街席位2.08亿元买入福建人气股，多路资金激烈博弈超声电子","brief":"①福建本地股尾盘异动拉升，平潭发展涨停，获开源证券西安西大街营业部买入2.08亿。\n②PCB概念股超声电子今日跌停，获三家机构买入1.23亿，遭深股通卖出1.06亿，国泰海通证券上海江苏路营业部卖出5281万。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/79ji1JjF80_973x642.png","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492418,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"费子豪","reading_num":288367,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492353,"ctime":1790241445,"title":"微软加码中东地区AI版图：2030年前将投资超100亿美元","brief":"①微软官宣，公司计划从现在到2030年，在中东地区投资超过100亿美元用于资本和运营支出； \n②微软总裁史密斯特别提到，鉴于当下的中东冲突，该公司正将数字化韧性作为其在中东地区战略的重点。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG111666652970_c604cb9294e6441e9ac00257037d2904_1790238754.jpeg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492353,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"赵昊","reading_num":272502,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492417,"ctime":1790241444,"title":"AI科技四季度行情可期吗？公募最新亮观点","brief":"①AI科技细分板块有望在四季度迎来财报驱动行情，盈利好、景气高的科技标的值得关注；\n②海外宏观、地缘等扰动风险仍然存在，可以通过均衡配置低估值、资源品等板块来分散风险。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/K4vN890UJC_2500x1667.jpg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492417,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"李迪","reading_num":281694,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":0,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492383,"ctime":1790241440,"title":"特朗普政府拟推海外美元稳定币计划 以巩固美元全球地位","brief":"①特朗普政府正在考虑一项旨在推广在海外使用美元计价稳定币的计划，以巩固美元作为全球储备资产的地位；\n②该项目可能涉及多个联邦机构，有消息人士指出，美国国际开发金融公司（DFC）也可能参与其中。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG111321300201_45a65dc95de94dc3894dd31999f77e5f_1790239285.jpeg","level":"C","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492383,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"周子意","reading_num":301696,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","moni